WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Jumping medium punch intercepts Ryu near the corner.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.700
The second jumping medium punch completes the target.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.750
After landing, OD Tomahawk Buster continues the juggle.

4
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.750
OD Condor Dive carries the juggle into Super pickup spacing.

5
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:08.100
Breezing Hawk spends one Super stock after the Dive.

6
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.250
Ryu falls after the Super finish at the corner.
